Open Vanilla 0035: the hangout's own player bots. OpenVanilla.Duels.HubBots (0-20) characters, one per class in
turn, on the bot AI's own accounts (never on the ladder), kept in duels_hub_bot and logged in while the realm
runs. Each gets the bot AI's gear, spells and talents the first time, and none of its own errands (no
questing, grinding, travel or following). In the hangout they walk about the pit and the stands, now and
then sit AFK for two to five minutes, and every OpenVanilla.Duels.HubBots.DuelSeconds (180) or so two idle
ones walk to the middle of the pit and duel (the hangout resets both after). They never queue. Needs
AiPlayerbot.Enabled, with no random bots logging in.

